node_modules/
www/
# The repo root's .gitignore blanket-excludes package-lock.json (added
# for an unrelated earlier npm experiment at the repo root) — this one
# is needed so CI's `npm ci` gets a real, reproducible lockfile.
!package-lock.json
android/app/build/
android/build/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/captures/
android/.idea/
# The release signing keystore — CI decodes it from a secret at build time
# (see .github/workflows/android-release.yml); it must never be committed.
# Matched anywhere under mobile-app/, not just android/app/ — a keystore
# generated per the README's instructions lands directly in mobile-app/
# (its `keytool` command has no destination path), and a rule scoped only
# to android/app/ silently misses it.
*.keystore
*.jks
ios/App/Pods/
ios/App/build/
ios/App/App.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
ios/App/App.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
ios/App/App/public/
